    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/4b3ade8585564bc199d4d16828f6d552.webp?t=1742183388\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dive into the darkness of an alternate world where Germany won the Second World War.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this world, secret and cruel experiments are conducted on humans to satisfy a thirst for control and power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are one of these guinea pigs, held captive in a research and experimentation center, subjected to the terrifying nightmares orchestrated by the sinister Dr. Schmidt and his team of unscrupulous doctors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/3ed82bb6114f4574dbb891293ad8efb8.poster.avif?t=1742183388\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/3ed82bb6114f4574dbb891293ad8efb8.webm?t=1742183388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/3ed82bb6114f4574dbb891293ad8efb8.mp4?t=1742183388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/9c23cd7ef00c3402a89aee73ab66a7b3.webp?t=1742183388\" /></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Run \u2192</strong> The main monster is a constant threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kill \u2192</strong> The corrupted creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Search \u2192</strong> Destroy crates, open drawers, and explore every corner to find runes, ammo, and healing items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft \u2192</strong> Combine your findings to create even rarer runes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sell \u2192</strong> Sell your runes to merchants in exchange for Tears of Resilience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade \u2192</strong> Runes enhance your skills, unlock new crafting options, and grant access to cosmetics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/f7b87fc3597fd6f5158fb9e9ade3b0e4.poster.avif?t=1742183388\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/f7b87fc3597fd6f5158fb9e9ade3b0e4.webm?t=1742183388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/f7b87fc3597fd6f5158fb9e9ade3b0e4.mp4?t=1742183388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Light will be your ally to regenerate your mental health.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into terrifying nightmares and use your passive and active skills to face them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/b62ac90d6d35b272b70415e5540248f9.poster.avif?t=1742183388\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/b62ac90d6d35b272b70415e5540248f9.webm?t=1742183388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/b62ac90d6d35b272b70415e5540248f9.mp4?t=1742183388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Passive powers give you permanent advantages, while active powers allow you to trigger powerful effects to get you out of difficult situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manipulate the frequency machine to alter the course of the game, intensify the difficulty, and accumulate more XP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To continue your journey through the nightmare, you must complete tasks to activate the portals by restoring the faces of the guardians.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/6f77d2bdbb47e3d8dde78aa7e70d5e3e.poster.avif?t=1742183388\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/6f77d2bdbb47e3d8dde78aa7e70d5e3e.webm?t=1742183388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/6f77d2bdbb47e3d8dde78aa7e70d5e3e.mp4?t=1742183388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/f00be3c08cf348ab3768d2901f9e1712.webp?t=1742183388\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/1bfa1466dc1caa1b820c362285db5af8.poster.avif?t=1742183388\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/1bfa1466dc1caa1b820c362285db5af8.webm?t=1742183388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/1bfa1466dc1caa1b820c362285db5af8.mp4?t=1742183388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of each game, you return to the lobby where you can spend your Tears of Resilience to purchase cosmetics, upgrade your plans, and improve your abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/ea90d501f2af07e7a7e68d8c3784c4d4.webp?t=1742183388\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Would you dare to complete the 15 Steam achievements?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/95efd55ee3b2b95b3793380b38ff83a7.poster.avif?t=1742183388\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/95efd55ee3b2b95b3793380b38ff83a7.webm?t=1742183388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/95efd55ee3b2b95b3793380b38ff83a7.mp4?t=1742183388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/1094a9eeaac6c9ce97a1d2cf1f5de716.avif?t=1742183388\" /></div></p>",
